// Custom code for the TikTok custom connector (TikTok API for Business v1.3).
//
// Every action is routed here. The script calls TikTok's endpoints itself, follows all pages, and
// returns flat rows whose keys are the Dataverse column names (without the sanidi_ prefix).
//
