// variable) is passed by the flows as the Access-Token header of every action. GetAccessToken
// exchanges an authorization code for that token once.
//
// TikTok answers HTTP 200 with {"code": <non-zero>, "message": ...} on errors; those are returned
// as HTTP 400 (429 for rate limits) with TikTok's message.
//
// The OPS block is generated by build_definition.py from spec.py. Do not edit it by hand.
